{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29088","headline":"闻韶州李相公移拜郴州因寄 · 许浑","name":"闻韶州李相公移拜郴州因寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏移丞相木兰舟，桂水潺湲岭北流。\n青汉梦归双阙曙，白云吟过五湖秋。\n恩回玉扆人先喜，道在金縢世不忧。\n闻说公卿尽南望，甘堂花暖凤池头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}